Written against Kartographer REL1_46 (ed9aaf9d). Without
$wgKartographerStaticMapframe, <mapframe> still put an <img> from
$wgKartographerMapServer/img/ in the page, and VisualEditor drew maps without
markers from it too. Femiwiki's map server, tile.openstreetmap.org, serves no
/img/ snapshots, so the request only failed and sent the page title to it.
This leaves the image out unless static mode is on, and has VisualEditor
always draw the interactive map. On an upgrade, check whether Kartographer
still makes the image in dynamic mode and refresh or drop this patch.

